  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/A1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE, confirming the 2026-09-25 entry; nothing changed since. Fixture: ruby emits ruby:m.rb:2-2:APP:variable (meta visibility_signal only, no constructed_from); php emits only C:class + file; elixir emits C, C.new, M, M.a and `calls M -> C.new` on the module, no @app symbol. test_constructed_from_parity.py:64-69 still says 'NO SYMBOL (WI-kavam)' for ruby (wrong). MECHANISM: php (php.py:1264) and elixir (_module_attribute_call :879 reads attributes for behaviours only) have no file-scope binding-symbol arm; ruby lacks only the constructed_from stamp. Title re-scoped. PROPOSED (owner): split into ruby key-stamp (+ fix the xfail reason) vs php/elixir symbol emission. ROOT-CAUSE GROUP: analyzer has no arm for the construct. Status unchanged."  # bcc5
